# Users

[Index](../README.md)

<p>User <strong>accounts</strong>. See <a href="https://guide.example/users">the guide</a>.</p>

## Endpoints

- [POST Create user](../endpoints/users-create.md) `{{base_url}}/users`
- [DELETE Delete user](../endpoints/users-delete.md) `{{base_url}}/users/{{user_id}}`
- [GET Get user](../endpoints/users-get.md) `{{base_url}}/users/{{user_id}}`
